       "acrm---key-feature-4-content": "<h3>An email to whoever follows up</h3><p>When a client or guest finishes, the coach gets an email that a result is in, with a link. Answers stay in the app, and employee quizzes saved without names send no alert.</p>",
       "alpb---prompt": "<p>Build a wellness quiz for my company's open enrollment week that names each employee's recharge style and links to the benefit that fits it.</p><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbPrompt = {\"default\": \"Build a wellness quiz for my company's open enrollment week that names each employee's recharge style and links to the benefit that fits it.\", \"chips\": [{\"label\": \"Recharge Style\", \"add\": \"Add 8 questions that match each answer to one of 4 recharge styles.\"}, {\"label\": \"Benefit Links\", \"add\": \"Add a list of the benefits that fit each style on the result screen.\"}, {\"label\": \"Coach Email Alerts\", \"add\": \"Add an email to the wellness coach with every answer when someone finishes.\"}, {\"label\": \"Results by Style\", \"add\": \"Add a dashboard that counts results by style each month.\"}]}; </script></div></div><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script id='awb-quiz-data'> window.awbQuiz = {\"version\":1,\"type\":\"matching\",\"title\":\"Find Your Wellness Style in 8 Everyday Questions\",\"intro\":\"Eight questions about your ordinary days. Your result names the way your answers lean toward recharging, with one small habit to try this week.\",\"questions\":[{\"text\":\"After a long week, what helps you feel like yourself again?\",\"options\":[{\"text\":\"A walk, a swim, or a bike ride\",\"result\":\"mover\"},{\"text\":\"Dinner or a call with people you like\",\"result\":\"connector\"},{\"text\":\"Getting the house and the week ahead in order\",\"result\":\"routine-keeper\"},{\"text\":\"A quiet evening with a book or a bath\",\"result\":\"quiet-recharger\"}]},{\"text\":\"You have a free hour on a weekday. How do you spend it?\",\"options\":[{\"text\":\"Out the door for some kind of movement\",\"result\":\"mover\"},{\"text\":\"Catching up with a friend or a neighbor\",\"result\":\"connector\"},{\"text\":\"Prepping meals or planning tomorrow\",\"result\":\"routine-keeper\"},{\"text\":\"Sitting somewhere quiet with no screen\",\"result\":\"quiet-recharger\"}]},{\"text\":\"Which small habit would you most like to keep?\",\"options\":[{\"text\":\"Taking the stairs and a lunchtime walk\",\"result\":\"mover\"},{\"text\":\"Checking in with one person each day\",\"result\":\"connector\"},{\"text\":\"Going to bed and waking at the same time\",\"result\":\"routine-keeper\"},{\"text\":\"10 minutes of quiet before the day starts\",\"result\":\"quiet-recharger\"}]},{\"text\":\"When stress builds up, what do you reach for first?\",\"options\":[{\"text\":\"Something physical to burn it off\",\"result\":\"mover\"},{\"text\":\"Someone to talk it through with\",\"result\":\"connector\"},{\"text\":\"A list, so the next step is clear\",\"result\":\"routine-keeper\"},{\"text\":\"Time alone to slow everything down\",\"result\":\"quiet-recharger\"}]},{\"text\":\"Pick the weekend plan that sounds best.\",\"options\":[{\"text\":\"A hike or a game of pickup basketball\",\"result\":\"mover\"},{\"text\":\"A cookout with friends and family\",\"result\":\"connector\"},{\"text\":\"A slow morning, errands done, a tidy home\",\"result\":\"routine-keeper\"},{\"text\":\"A long nap and an afternoon in the garden\",\"result\":\"quiet-recharger\"}]},{\"text\":\"What makes a workday feel balanced?\",\"options\":[{\"text\":\"Getting up from the desk every hour\",\"result\":\"mover\"},{\"text\":\"A good conversation with a coworker\",\"result\":\"connector\"},{\"text\":\"Finishing on time with tomorrow planned\",\"result\":\"routine-keeper\"},{\"text\":\"A real lunch break away from messages\",\"result\":\"quiet-recharger\"}]},{\"text\":\"Which wellness program would you sign up for?\",\"options\":[{\"text\":\"A step challenge with a weekly goal\",\"result\":\"mover\"},{\"text\":\"A team volunteer day\",\"result\":\"connector\"},{\"text\":\"A sleep and morning routine series\",\"result\":\"routine-keeper\"},{\"text\":\"A guided breathing or quiet-time session\",\"result\":\"quiet-recharger\"}]},{\"text\":\"What would you tell a friend who feels run down?\",\"options\":[{\"text\":\"Get outside and move for a bit\",\"result\":\"mover\"},{\"text\":\"Call someone and make plans\",\"result\":\"connector\"},{\"text\":\"Pick one routine and stick with it for a week\",\"result\":\"routine-keeper\"},{\"text\":\"Take an evening off and rest\",\"result\":\"quiet-recharger\"}]}],\"results\":[{\"key\":\"mover\",\"title\":\"Mover\",\"description\":\"Your answers lean toward recharging through movement: walks, rides, games, anything that gets you out of a chair. Try putting one short walk on the calendar each day, at the same time, and treat it like a meeting.\"},{\"key\":\"connector\",\"title\":\"Connector\",\"description\":\"Your answers lean toward recharging with other people. A good talk or a shared meal resets your week. Try one standing plan each week, such as a Thursday walk or a Sunday call, so time with people does not depend on luck.\"},{\"key\":\"routine-keeper\",\"title\":\"Routine Keeper\",\"description\":\"Your answers lean toward recharging through order: a plan for tomorrow, regular hours, a tidy space. Pick one routine to protect this week, such as a set bedtime or a Sunday plan for the week, and keep it for 7 days.\"},{\"key\":\"quiet-recharger\",\"title\":\"Quiet Recharger\",\"description\":\"Your answers lean toward recharging in quiet: time alone, no screens, a slower pace. Try blocking 20 minutes each day with no messages and nothing to finish, and guard it the way you would guard a meeting.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
      }
     }
    ]
   }
